00:04:49,411 --> 00:04:55,411
Mischief loves company.

2
00:09:38,823 --> 00:09:44,823
The Little Rascals is a romance, comedy, family
film directed by Penelope Spheeris.

3
00:14:28,235 --> 00:14:34,235
When nine-year-old Alfalfa falls for Darla, his
"He-Man-Woman-Hating" friends attempt to sabotage their relationship.

4
